+validate
+========
+
+See :ref:`cli_validate`.
+
+::
+
+    Usage: sqlite-utils validate [OPTIONS] PATH TABLE SCHEMA
+
+      Validate a table against a JSON Schema file
+
+      Exits 0 if the table passes, 1 if violations were found, and 2 if the check
+      could not be run at all (missing table, bad schema).
+
+      Example:
